WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.249 line:91%
Chapter 18. For students. Listening, and word cards.

00:00:05.668 --> 00:00:09.028 line:91%
Your teacher starts a listening. Tap your name.

00:00:10.195 --> 00:00:16.447 line:91%
At the top, you see your level: Starter, Explorer or Champion. Your help follows your level.

00:00:16.905 --> 00:00:24.368 line:91%
Before you listen, look at the key words. Tap a word: read the meaning and the example. Tap the speaker to listen.

00:00:26.884 --> 00:00:29.327 line:91%
Then guess: what will you hear?

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:35.609 line:91%
Listen to the speakers, and answer the question about the main idea.

00:00:36.586 --> 00:00:45.068 line:91%
Then listen again, and answer the details. You can play it on your phone too. Use earphones, please! The turtle makes it slower.

00:00:48.221 --> 00:00:55.414 line:91%
Check: see your answers. Tap "Hear it": it plays the part with the answer. The text lights up while you listen.

00:00:55.875 --> 00:01:01.294 line:91%
Dictation: tap "Listen", type the sentence, and send. You have one try.

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:08.294 line:91%
Red words are missing or wrong. Read the right sentence, and say it.

00:01:08.748 --> 00:01:13.374 line:91%
Last, speak with a partner. Then write, and send it to your teacher.

00:01:16.873 --> 00:01:24.935 line:91%
At the bottom, "Word cards" has all the new words of the unit. "Quick check" is a game: read the meaning, and find the word.

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:32.514 line:91%
In reading texts, words with a line under them open a card too. Tap, read, and listen. Well done!
